fection control, and patient safety while allowing repeated practice without risk. Ideal for students and clinical professionals, this immersive training improves procedural confidence and supports competency-based learning in a controlled virtual environment.", "short_description": "Arterial Blood Gas is an immersive VR training simulation that teaches the step-by-step ABG sampling procedure. Practice patient interaction, equipment preparation, arterial puncture, and post-procedure care in a realistic, risk-free clinical environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nbme.org/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MedVR Education", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://medvr.education/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26078978881709702"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "861965976755928"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "861965976755928"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769690340, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "861965976755928"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26397285343212386", "version": "2.2"}, "id": "1203710505223436", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false